    *
    * Both product (prodMantissa) and addend (addAligned) will represent
    * integers at scale 2^(prodExp - 173), where:
    *   actual_product = prodMantissa * 2^(prodExp - 173)
    *   actual_addend  = addAligned  * 2^(prodExp - 173)
