/** ShiftVectorLeft: shifts vector left (fills right with zeros), non-wrapping.
  * in[o] goes to out[o + shift] if (o + shift) < n, otherwise zero.
  * Positions 0 .. shift-1 are zero.
  * Equivalently: out[d] = in[d - shift] if d >= shift, else 0.
